  41:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_conv_opt_q15.c ****  * @brief Convolution of Q15 sequences.
  42:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_conv_opt_q15.c ****  * @param[in] *pSrcA points to the first input sequence.
